flowchart TD
  Start([Start])
  Decision{Is valid?}
  Process[Process Request]
  Cache{{Check Cache}}
  Store[(Data Store)]
  Done([Done])
  Error[Return Error]

  Start --> Cache
  Cache -->|hit| Done
  Cache -->|miss| Decision
  Decision -->|yes| Process
  Decision -->|no| Error
  Process --> Store
  Store --> Done
